--- !u!114 &836730951
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 836730950}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e98cbb660b5c1bd438dce699d957e299, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  panel: {fileID: 1844690647}
  lineText: {fileID: 901519637}
  characterName: {fileID: 764187532}
  portrait: {fileID: 1252336623}
  lines:
  - speaker: Jerry | The Clown
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 138aa489bcb33bc448ab609e4c8fdb5d, type: 3}
    text: Hey, why does everyone have a cool intro and I'm just... funny?
  - speaker: Morgan | The Jester
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 759b90a643a463c429ad257bd031c4de, type: 3}
    text: Oh man shut up, you're the clown, that's what you signed up for
  - speaker: Jack | The Strongman
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b2c878a63f5fbb4c8b211faf7cad4c0, type: 3}
    text: Don't mind these two, Max. Why are we practicing this again, anyone comes
      to see us perform anymore...
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: Oh, Jack! We're just going to make the biggest comeback! There will be
      thousands of people in the audience, you just need to trust this!
  - speaker: Valerie | The Majorette
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aed60bd871c49d04480535ef5790c9e0, type: 3}
    text: Trust what, sir? We're already professionals and practice our skills and
      tricks every day, we cannot get any better
  - speaker: Roxanne | The Lion Tamer
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 28379fa6b0ee9a34fa675fb977410b50, type: 3}
    text: Yeah, Valerie's right. Why are only 7 of us in today's reharsal? we better
      get an extra payment after these hours of nonsense!
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: Well, as for that statementof yours lady Valeria, I may have to object.
  - speaker: Celeste | The Tightrope Walker
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1e572a4f6c1ba5f4b8e7877ce2b6b4af, type: 3}
    text: Oh, so you really think we can get even better... Try to walk up that rope
      in pointe shoes and come back and tell me "we can get better"!
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: My dearest circus people, it's not about your skills, it's about what I
      have in my pocket right here. I introduce you to...
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: THE IMPROVEMENT FORMULA!!!
  - speaker: Celeste | The Tightrope Walker
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1e572a4f6c1ba5f4b8e7877ce2b6b4af, type: 3}
    text: ...
  - speaker: Valerie | The Majorette
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aed60bd871c49d04480535ef5790c9e0, type: 3}
    text: ...
  - speaker: Morgan | The Jester
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 759b90a643a463c429ad257bd031c4de, type: 3}
    text: And how's an alien looking drink going to make us improve if I may ask?
      That thing looks radioactive
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: Well, that's why I got the most skilled people in the circus today. You
      all need to try it!
  - speaker: Morgan | The Jester
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 759b90a643a463c429ad257bd031c4de, type: 3}
    text: Try it?? What are you trying to do, poison us?
  - speaker: Roxanne | The Lion Tamer
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 28379fa6b0ee9a34fa675fb977410b50, type: 3}
    text: Alright, I'm out
  - speaker: Jack | The Strongman
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b2c878a63f5fbb4c8b211faf7cad4c0, type: 3}
    text: Same for me, good luck everyone
  - speaker: Jerry | The Clown
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 138aa489bcb33bc448ab609e4c8fdb5d, type: 3}
    text: My bus is coming in 10 mins, I'll better change my clothes and-
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: YOU'RE NOT GOING ANYWHERE, ANY OF YOU!
  - speaker: Jerry | The Clown
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 138aa489bcb33bc448ab609e4c8fdb5d, type: 3}
    text: Well! Too bad I'm just walking out of the- oh?
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: Well! Too bad the entire tent is locked! Alright, who goes first?
  - speaker: Morgan | The Jester
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 759b90a643a463c429ad257bd031c4de, type: 3}
    text: This man is crazy! Locking us? Really??
  - speaker: Valerie | The Majorette
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aed60bd871c49d04480535ef5790c9e0, type: 3}
    text: Guys, it can't be that bad, it's just a sip, right?
  - speaker: Celeste | The Tightrope Walker
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1e572a4f6c1ba5f4b8e7877ce2b6b4af, type: 3}
    text: I still don't want to try it, though
  - speaker: Valerie | The Majorette
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aed60bd871c49d04480535ef5790c9e0, type: 3}
    text: Yeah... being honest, I don't want to either...
  - speaker: Jerry | The Clown
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 138aa489bcb33bc448ab609e4c8fdb5d, type: 3}
    text: Why do you even say it's not bad then? These kids-
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: Well, well, well! Nobody wants to go first?
  - speaker: Jerry | The Clown
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 138aa489bcb33bc448ab609e4c8fdb5d, type: 3}
    text: Valerie wants t-
  - speaker: Celeste | The Tightrope Walker
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1e572a4f6c1ba5f4b8e7877ce2b6b4af, type: 3}
    text: No, she doesn't.
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: Too bad! As expected... I've got the solution for this, though. Let's play
      a game!
  - speaker: Morgan | The Jester
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 759b90a643a463c429ad257bd031c4de, type: 3}
    text: I'm scared...
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: Okay so the rules are simple. A big number will appear on screen, that's
      the number of spots it will count.
  - speaker: Valerie | The Majorette
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aed60bd871c49d04480535ef5790c9e0, type: 3}
    text: Count what exactly, sir?
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: Count you all, of course! Whoever the number lands on, takes a sip of my
      great invention!
  - speaker: Jerry | The Clown
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 138aa489bcb33bc448ab609e4c8fdb5d, type: 3}
    text: Well that makes sense if we knew where the count is starting from, dude.
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: Oh you *will* know! just with a little clue.
  - speaker: Jack | The Strongman
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b2c878a63f5fbb4c8b211faf7cad4c0, type: 3}
    text: Which clue? I'm not trusting this at all..
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: I will say the spot, but saying who stood there in the previous round!
  - speaker: Celeste | The Tightrope Walker
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1e572a4f6c1ba5f4b8e7877ce2b6b4af, type: 3}
    text: Round???
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: Of course! All of you need to try it! So there will be 7 rounds. Oh! and
      you have to change positions every round. No cheating!
  - speaker: Roxanne | The Lion Tamer
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 28379fa6b0ee9a34fa675fb977410b50, type: 3}
    text: What about the first round, there's nobody standing anywhere to get the
      clue from...
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: Oh! First round is just random. Good luck everyone!
  - speaker: Morgan | The Jester
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 759b90a643a463c429ad257bd031c4de, type: 3}
    text: WH-
  - speaker: Valerie | The Majorette
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aed60bd871c49d04480535ef5790c9e0, type: 3}
    text: What about the direction? which direction will the counting follow?
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: Smart, lady Valerie! Just don't look at the clock for reference!
  - speaker: Morgan | The Jester
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 759b90a643a463c429ad257bd031c4de, type: 3}
    text: WHAT IS HE SAYING! GUYS???
  - speaker: Jerry | The Clown
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 138aa489bcb33bc448ab609e4c8fdb5d, type: 3}
    text: ...
  - speaker: Roxanne | The Lion Tamer
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 28379fa6b0ee9a34fa675fb977410b50, type: 3}
    text: ...
  - speaker: Maximilian | Ringmaster
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 77fb5e100fbee274ebbbaeb9cdb42483, type: 3}
    text: Let's get going everyone! Choose a spot!
  typingSpeed: 0.03
